","breakfast","snack","dinner"],"reply":"Yum! What was the tastiest thing?"},{"id":"outside","keywords":["park","outside","walk","garden","swing"],"reply":"Outside is lovely! What did you see there?"},{"id":"school","keywords":["school","friend","class"],"reply":"School! What was the best part?"}],"quickReplies":[{"id":"q1","visual":"🧸","say":"I played","conceptId":"play"},{"id":"q2","visual":"🍽️","say":"I ate yummy food","conceptId":"eat"},{"id":"q3","visual":"🌳","say":"I went outside","conceptId":"outside"},{"id":"q4","visual":"🏫","say":"I went to school","conceptId":"school"}],"modelSentence":"Today I played with my toys.","fallbackReply":"That sounds like a lovely day! Tell me one more thing.","followUps":["What happened next?","What was your favourite part?"],"maxTurns":3,"hints":[]}]}'::jsonb,'published','reviewed',1,3) on conflict (id) do update set title=excluded.title, description=excluded.description, configuration=excluded.configuration, status=excluded.status, review_status=excluded.review_status, version=excluded.version, estimated_duration=excluded.estimated_duration;
